sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Mon as Monitoring
    participant GW as Incident gateway
    participant Dedup as Deduplicator
    participant Sched as On-call schedule
    participant N as Notifier
    participant IC as Incident commander
    Mon->>GW: alert fires
    GW->>Dedup: group by service and cause
    alt already an open incident
        Dedup-->>GW: attach to it, no second page
    else new
        Dedup->>Sched: who is on call for this service
        Sched-->>N: target
        N->>IC: page
        alt not acknowledged in time
            N->>IC: escalate to secondary
        end
        IC->>GW: acknowledge, open a channel
    end
    IC->>GW: resolve, write the timeline
